# Kelly's Fearless Focus plan

Chapter 5 asks who I want to be, and whether my goals are really mine. Chapter 1 asks me to deal with the old goals and dreams that still float around in my head: to pursue them, or to lay them to rest by a conscious decision.

* Playing in a band is laid to rest: I choose to spend my time on my health and on Brainstorm instead.
* I reached 3rd dan in karate, so that goal is achieved. I stopped training after two hip replacements, so carrying on is laid to rest.
* Writing has given way to software development and AI engineering on the train. Another book may come one day, so it is on hold.

FocusPlan: Kelly's Fearless Focus plan
    WhoIWantToBe: A healthy, focused builder of software that helps people, with time and energy for my family
    Assessments:
    * Where I am
        Schedule: Monthly check|Monthly||2026-11-04
        Items:
        * Weight|Health|kg|Weigh yourself first thing in the morning, before breakfast|84
        * Waist|Health|cm|Measure around your belly button, breathing out
        * Distance in 30 minutes|Health|km|Walk or jog for 30 minutes and measure how far you get with a phone app
        * HbA1c|Health|mmol/mol|From my latest blood test
        * Alcohol-free nights|Health|nights a week|Count the nights in the last week with no alcohol at all
        * Relationship with my partner|Relationships|1-10|1 is abysmal and 10 is perfect
        * Relationship with my children|Relationships|1-10|1 is abysmal and 10 is perfect
        * Relationship with my parents|Relationships|1-10|1 is abysmal and 10 is perfect
        * Relationships with my closest friends|Relationships|1-10|1 is abysmal and 10 is perfect
        * Monthly income|Money|per month|Everything that comes in: your job, rent, royalties, dividends and interest
        * Monthly expenses|Money|per month|Every regular payment: mortgage, loans, bills, food, fuel and insurance
        * Net assets|Money|total|Everything you own, minus everything you owe
        * Happiness|Mind|1-10|1 is absolutely miserable and 10 is perfectly happy and content
        * Coping with negative emotions|Mind|1-10|1 is terrible and 10 is excellent
        * Hours building Brainstorm|Work|hours a week|Count the hours spent on development and AI engineering
